Doc dung
--------
- `Error:speech_end` la KET QUA DUNG cua lan chay nay, khong phai loi:
  khong co ai noi vao mic, engine cho het 15 giay
  (VoiceAssistantService.kt LISTENING_TIMEOUT_MS = 15_000) roi bao
  "chua nghe ro". e2e_ms=15845 gan het bang dung timeout do.
- Hai o intent/utterance la "-" vi khong co cau nao duoc nhan.
- Chua co lan chay nao CO tieng noi. Bo 22 cau cua benchmark van chua
  chay tren may that: `run_benchmark.ps1 -Adb` chi HUNG logcat, khong bom
  cau vao; service chi co ACTION_START_LISTENING, khong co duong text.
  Muon co so lieu that thi phai co nguoi noi vao mic.
